betterquesting.quest.2R1OOnI5S0K57TglRYmGng.desc="僵尸猪人"？那些僵尸在搞什么鬼？!也许晚上你必须把你的动物关好...

# Quest: Time to Kill (Cow)
betterquesting.quest.6nKJ4mC3QB-i5nx8UXrPew.name=杀戮时刻(牛)
betterquesting.quest.6nKJ4mC3QB-i5nx8UXrPew.desc=我觉得需要一个新的背包. 让我们宰几头牛.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Witch)
betterquesting.quest.8G4ZvwvWQpihM6NfflMw7A.name=杀戮时刻(女巫)
betterquesting.quest.8G4ZvwvWQpihM6NfflMw7A.desc=女巫既可恨又危险,她们总是躲在远处向你扔药水.要小心!

# Quest: MEGAKILL!
betterquesting.quest.C7CLvAjyQUy2aNW1HiA7Ow.name=§4§l杀人如麻!
betterquesting.quest.C7CLvAjyQUy2aNW1HiA7Ow.desc=你把他们全都杀了！§c你真是个怪物！

# Quest: Time to Kill (Chicken)
betterquesting.quest.G8aNnibAQVuX1SG7XfuaeQ.name=杀戮时刻(鸡)
betterquesting.quest.G8aNnibAQVuX1SG7XfuaeQ.desc=别叫了,没用的. 乖乖变成鸡汤吧！

# Quest: Time to Kill (Magma Cube)
betterquesting.quest.JVB4_UIXR9SI2W66FWBnMw.name=杀戮时刻(岩浆怪)
betterquesting.quest.JVB4_UIXR9SI2W66FWBnMw.desc=Now a Hell version of your slime!

# Quest: Time to Kill (Sheep)
betterquesting.quest.NASNKN6AQ52JY7XDbODGYQ.name=杀戮时刻(羊)
betterquesting.quest.NASNKN6AQ52JY7XDbODGYQ.desc=哦不,别是那可怜的羊! 羊毛满是血,我好伤心.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Blaze)
betterquesting.quest.Q70rGIFTR6uMPmobimGr9g.name=杀戮时刻(烈焰人)
betterquesting.quest.Q70rGIFTR6uMPmobimGr9g.desc=你应该小心这个任务,强烈推荐火焰保护.

# Quest: Martian Invasion Ship
betterquesting.quest.Q8FZdwiURgC2PoD4IziLJg.name=火星入侵者飞船
betterquesting.quest.Q8FZdwiURgC2PoD4IziLJg.desc=火星入侵者飞船是游戏后期的BOSS，击败它可以获得§6UFO硬币§r，这种硬币可用于制作建筑机器人。%n%n可以通过制作火星入侵者飞船物品来召唤它。

# Quest: Time to Kill (Wither Skeleton)
betterquesting.quest.R08JrEz2SLGeV9zwAFydaQ.name=杀戮时刻(凋灵骷髅)
betterquesting.quest.R08JrEz2SLGeV9zwAFydaQ.desc=借尔项上§o头颅§r一用!!! <-- 这是每一个玩家看到凋灵骷髅心里想的吧.%n%n要是你还不知道的话,这里提一句,将4个灵魂沙摆成竖着的T形,然后在上头放3个凋灵骷髅头,你就能召唤出凋灵BOSS了. 别在你的基地里这么干.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Slime)
betterquesting.quest.Z-RsAsrVRM2a3zWP5a0OsQ.name=杀戮时刻(史莱姆)
betterquesting.quest.Z-RsAsrVRM2a3zWP5a0OsQ.desc=又黏又弹!现在有很多变种. 跟我的小朋友打个招呼,柠檬片!

# Quest: Balls-O-Tron
betterquesting.quest.ZeBLQUsPS72HAxsrR9s_3g.name=机械蠕虫
betterquesting.quest.ZeBLQUsPS72HAxsrR9s_3g.desc=机械蠕虫是§dNTM§r的第二位boss。它可以通过使用面具人硬币制作的§6银钥匙§r与§e丛林地牢§r中的机械师之环交互或者制造机械蠕虫召唤物来召唤。

# Quest: Time to Kill (Spiders)
betterquesting.quest.ZpKjClvCTGe4ytw_Yu6mYQ.name=杀戮时刻(蜘蛛)
betterquesting.quest.ZpKjClvCTGe4ytw_Yu6mYQ.desc=呃呃呃啊！会爬墙的怪物，还毛茸茸的！杀了他们。快一点！注意那些女巫蜘蛛，它们会以牙还牙。

# Quest: Time to Kill (Creeper)
betterquesting.quest.fsdmCm47S3KB0X1A5MZwJg.name=杀戮时刻(苦力怕)
betterquesting.quest.fsdmCm47S3KB0X1A5MZwJg.desc=谁没有经历过这个...你正忙着自己的活，挖了几个钻石，转眼间你就在床上醒来,所有物品都没了!%n%n是时候反击了!

# Quest: Time to Kill (Zombie)
betterquesting.quest.gLK6mwA4ShOoVbZQZlM94w.name=杀戮时刻(僵尸)
betterquesting.quest.gLK6mwA4ShOoVbZQZlM94w.desc=没人知道他们是谁,或是来自哪里.他们就是晚上很吵,而且蠢到连工作台都做不出来.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Squid)
betterquesting.quest.hGvVPGL0SHmF0FpB4r600A.name=杀戮时刻(鱿鱼)
betterquesting.quest.hGvVPGL0SHmF0FpB4r600A.desc=美味的鱿鱼. 我们正在做冬阴功海鲜汤(Tom Yum seafood).

# Quest: Time to Kill (Ghast)
betterquesting.quest.j_v3k9rtT0CrTh_RsbyO6g.name=杀戮时刻(恶魂)
betterquesting.quest.j_v3k9rtT0CrTh_RsbyO6g.desc=恶魂会向你发射爆炸性火球,但是如果你可以将他们扔过来的火球打回去的话它们也很脆弱. 你的护甲升级,火焰保护和爆炸保护!

# Quest: Time to Kill (Enderman)
betterquesting.quest.krQA1CjtRA2eMTLNCHn7iA.name=杀戮时刻(末影人)
betterquesting.quest.krQA1CjtRA2eMTLNCHn7iA.desc=呃,花俏的传送珍珠.你需要它们.全部!现在!

# Quest: Time to Kill (Skeleton)
betterquesting.quest.lf-pKhIVShSHFv38Gg56lg.name=杀戮时刻(骷髅)
betterquesting.quest.lf-pKhIVShSHFv38Gg56lg.desc=当你拿来射人的时候,箭矢棒棒的,但当你是被射的那个的时候,就不是什么好东西了.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Silverfish)
betterquesting.quest.pSowjULQT4ep05MVXa7BJQ.name=杀戮时刻(蠹虫)
betterquesting.quest.pSowjULQT4ep05MVXa7BJQ.desc=小心,它们喜欢用与石头有关的方块来伪装和克隆自己!(只对原版方块有效)可以在地牢和山丘群系里找到.还可以在水栖苦力怕生成的圆石球里找到.

# Quest: Time to Kill (Wither)
betterquesting.quest.q1ilrpayTHWJ-bajd9WM1A.name=杀戮时刻(凋灵)
betterquesting.quest.q1ilrpayTHWJ-bajd9WM1A.desc=收集了几个凋灵骷髅头之后,你觉得你应该需要再多做点事--那为什么不杀一个凋灵怪？


### Quests in multiple quest lines ###

# Quest: Armor Modifications
betterquesting.quest.3J7vD46NQg6IMMDRALpT-A.name=护甲改装
betterquesting.quest.3J7vD46NQg6IMMDRALpT-A.desc=§3装甲改装台§r允许你在护甲上加装各种护甲改装附件，从而提供增益、新能力或额外防护。

# Quest: Dyson Swarms
betterquesting.quest.3WDOW4oRQoO6WN6291ZuNw.name=戴森云
betterquesting.quest.3WDOW4oRQoO6WN6291ZuNw.desc=§3戴森云§r由数千个环绕星系恒星的云模块组成，云的发电量随着云模块数量的增加而增加。然而，这些卫星模块无法无限期使用，它们会随着时间的推移而损毁，损毁几率随着云模块数量的增加而增加。%n%n§6戴森云模块§r必须通过使用一个巨大的离心发射平台（称为§3蜂群投射器§r）发射到太阳轨道。投射器一次发射4个云模块，消耗大量电力。%n%n§3戴森云接收器§r是从戴森云中收集能量的主要机器。它将从云中收集的巨大能量集中成一道极其强大的光束。只需要设置一个与现有云匹配的卫星ID芯片。能量束必须指向戴森云能量转换器、热量转换器等转换器。%n%n§3卫星雷达中继器§r可用于允许戴森云在夜间提供电力。

# Quest: Quests information
betterquesting.quest.45ow6xFKTQ6GHVi3FG_dtQ.name=任务信息
betterquesting.quest.45ow6xFKTQ6GHVi3FG_dtQ.desc=[warn]This Questbook was originally made by _SkippyPlaysMC_ for NT:I/ST:I modpacks and modified by Bufka2011.[/warn]%n%nNotes:%n%n§b1) This questbook does not contain all the content from the mod, such as the guns, many armor sets and others. Make sure to browse NEI.%n%n2) §lThere are two types of quests §r§3§b- primary and secondary. Primary quests are quests with unique shape and bold lines between each other.%n%n3) When updating the modpack to newer versions that has introduced changes to the questbook, in case the quests dont update, delete the betterquesting folder in the world file.%nAfter it is deleted, turn on cheats and do "/bq_admin edit true", head over to the chapter of your choice, press the designer button (the one with many squares), click on your quest of choice and finally press the autocomplete button (checkmark) to complete the quests previously completed.%n%n§r§bSpecial thanks to everyone on discord who helped out with questions and recommendations while making the quests, as well as the official NTM Wiki for providing information used in the quests.

# Quest: Modpack information
betterquesting.quest.5VAtBoWDTLmFNrWxLbn9IA.name=整合包信息
betterquesting.quest.5VAtBoWDTLmFNrWxLbn9IA.desc=欢迎游玩§5核科技：新视野§r！%n%n在开始前请先阅读以下的信息：%n%n§b1) 请记住在背包界面使用§3§dServer Utilities§r来声明您的基地并强加载你的反应堆所在区块。%n%n2) 如果着色器出现故障，尝试使用fancy textures。%n%n3) 如果您遇到任何渲染问题，请尝试在§dNEI§r界面中滚动浏览。%n%n4) 如果你是与朋友一起玩游戏，请务必将他们邀请到你的《更好的任务》队伍中，这样你们就可以共享游戏进度和奖励了。%n

# Quest: Dyson Anatmogenesis Terraformer
betterquesting.quest.6k-JrbD-S8GO9PRRthWNRA.name=戴森云大气改造器
betterquesting.quest.6k-JrbD-S8GO9PRRthWNRA.desc=§3戴森云大气改造器§r在所有现有的§3戴森云转换器§r中是效用最多的，其接收来自接收器的光束并提供直接的能量到质量转换，产生行星规模的大气气体，根据玩家的意愿对任何行星或卫星进行地球化改造。%n%n默认情况下，它会向大气中释放氧气，一旦超过0.1个大气压的呼吸阈值，大气就会变得可呼吸。可以使用流体识别码切换排放的气体，使用螺丝刀可以在从大气中排放或提取气体之间切换。%n%n如果由戴森云提供§e150THE/s§r的功率（相当于1024个云模块），则达到0.1个大气压需要8小时。

# Quest: Maskman
betterquesting.quest.8b6batCvQvCiGknitRMrSQ.name=面具人
betterquesting.quest.8b6batCvQvCiGknitRMrSQ.desc=面具人是NTM模组的第一个BOSS。要召唤它，你需要处于辐射中毒状态（50Rad）。当满足这个条件后，每位玩家都会开始一个20分钟的计时器。时间一到，面具人就会出现。在它出现前1分钟，会有一个警告提示。如果玩家的辐射剂量已降至安全水平，那么计时器就会重新开始计时。

# Quest: Glyphids
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQ.name=异虫
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQ.desc=§6Glyphids§r are large insects that have many different types. They primarily spawn with naturally generated §6§rhives§r structures. All of the types are armored and they take less damage than against normal mobs. Glyphids are normally attracted to pollution created by the player, and usually have to be dealt with by the player.%n%n§6§r§6Hives§r can spawn naturally in all non-ocean biomes and can also be created by glyphid scouts. They contain several glyphid egg blocks and some low-tier loot inside, lying on top of eggs. glyphid egg blocks spawn glyphids and drop glyphid eggs upon destruction.%n%nGlyphids now periodically retarget the closest player every 5 seconds if their current target is farther. 1/3 of glyphids do not have this behavior to prevent infinite trapping.%n%n§2It is recommended that all hives are destroyed as soon as possible as to prevent their spread later on.

# Quest: Useful Tools
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACA.name=撬棍
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACA.desc=有许多工具可以帮助你顺利完成这个模组的流程，其中最重要的有：%n%n§6钨长臂夹§r，能有效减少玩家从背包物品中吸收的辐射。此外，它还能避免那些高温物品点燃你。%n%n§6撬棍§r，用于打开各种结构中发现的板条箱以获取食物和弹药等战利品。

# Quest: Tantalium
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAiw.name=钽
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAiw.desc=§6钽§r是一种用于制造某些物品的材料，其中最重要的是§6电容板§r。钽晶体的生产需要§6钶钽铁矿§r，而钶钽铁矿可以通过使用§6钶钽铁矿指针§r来寻找。此外，还可以利用§b高性能溶剂§r处理§e重金属基岩矿石§r来获取钽。%n%n§2钶钽铁矿在其加工阶段早期可提供催化裂化塔所需的铌元素。

# Quest: Hunger System
betterquesting.quest.Fio9CeHtR9-O6cehKBCH5g.name=饥饿系统
betterquesting.quest.Fio9CeHtR9-O6cehKBCH5g.desc=§dHunger Overhaul§r makes hunger a genuine threat rather than a mild inconvenience.%n%nHunger now drains passively over time, even while idle. Reaching zero kills you instantly. Low hunger inflicts slowness, weakness, and reduced mining speed before that point. Eating grants a §6Well Fed§r effect that boosts health regeneration - the larger the meal, the longer it lasts.%n%nFood values are re-balanced by meal size. Raw ingredients restore very little; prepared meals restore substantially more. Larger meals take longer to eat and stack less in your inventory.%n%nCrops only grow during daytime and take much longer to mature. Wood and stone hoes are removed - you need at least an iron hoe to till soil. Farmland must be placed adjacent to water or it will not function.%n%n§dSpice of Life: Carrot Edition§r rewards dietary variety. Each unique food eaten for the first time permanently increases your maximum health. Eating the same food repeatedly provides no bonus.%n%n§2The more diverse your diet, the more hearts you have - build a varied farm as early as possible.§r

# Quest: Red Key
betterquesting.quest.NB6qs0xZSHaY5Sik2IoTxg.name=红色钥匙
betterquesting.quest.NB6qs0xZSHaY5Sik2IoTxg.desc=§6红色钥匙§r能够打开任何需要使用普通钥匙才能打开的容器，无论锁的锁芯结构如何；它也是仅有的两把能够打开那种位于奇怪的石头上的锁的钥匙之一，从而可以进入§e红房间§r。这种钥匙没有使用期限限制，可以无限次重复使用。%n%n

# Quest: Safes and lockpicking
betterquesting.quest.VoxsH2isSheNEKaJ3_Ikgg.name=保险箱与撬锁
betterquesting.quest.VoxsH2isSheNEKaJ3_Ikgg.desc=§6螺丝刀§r可以用来旋转传送带以及建造§3芝加哥反应堆§r。它也可以消耗§6发卡§r来解锁各种遗迹中发现的§6保险箱§r。

# Quest: The End of Space...
betterquesting.quest.XbTJRWJNTKa4UEeLPV0urg.name=宇宙的尽头...
betterquesting.quest.XbTJRWJNTKa4UEeLPV0urg.desc=Well, you've completed the space stage of the game; now the entire space knows and fears you (you are a true space pirate). Here are a couple more nuances about the §3Dyson swarm§r:%n%n§2Do not place §3converters§r directly next to the §3receiver§r - this will cause a malfunction.§r%n%n§2Multiple players in the same game world can create multiple §3swarms§r, but keep in mind that different swarms reduce each other's §eefficiency§r. This can encourage players to either work together on one common §3swarm§r or compete to extract more §eenergy§r from their own §3swarm§r.§r

# Quest: Agriculture and Farming
betterquesting.quest.Zpwlu-OeTpCvf7vTFz-BIA.name=农业与种植
betterquesting.quest.Zpwlu-OeTpCvf7vTFz-BIA.desc=Three mods overhaul farming and food in this pack.%n%n§dPam's HarvestCraft§r adds 40+ crops, many fruit trees, 10 fish, beekeeping, and 75+ foods. Key blocks: §3Presser§r (produces oils, honey, etc.), §3Market§r (buys seeds and saplings for emeralds), §3Shipping Block§r (sells crops for emeralds). Right-clicking a mature crop harvests and replants it.%n%n§dAgriCraft§r adds genetics-based crop breeding. Plants have six stats - Growth, Gain, Strength, Resistance, Fertility, and Mutativity - inherited from parent crops when cross-breeding. Higher stats are dominant. Mutations can unlock new crop species entirely. Weeds will compete with and eventually kill unmanaged crops. Plants have specific soil, light, and fluid requirements, so placement matters.%n%n§dHunger Overhaul§r requires farmland to be placed adjacent to water - untouched dry tilled soil will not function.%n%n§2Note that the crops should be planted on the Crop Sticks.

# Quest: Compressor
betterquesting.quest.jcaOirN6QCOC50YJbil2rQ.name=压缩机
betterquesting.quest.jcaOirN6QCOC50YJbil2rQ.desc=§3压缩机§r是一种专门的多块机器，用于给流体加压。它可以对任何流体进行操作以增加其压力，以便在其他机器中使用。其中一些流体可以被压缩成另一种流体。

# Quest: Guide Book
betterquesting.quest.qxRS5162RCW1IG--2Ibg7g.name=指导书
betterquesting.quest.qxRS5162RCW1IG--2Ibg7g.desc=While the §6Quest Book§r tries to give as much information as possible, it is not a full guide to all the content in the game.%n%nThat's what §6Guide Book§r is used for! Community-curated, constantly growing and &q&zawesome§r-looking!%n%n§2Note: this Guide Book can be opened via the keybind


### Quests in no quest lines ###

# Quest: Additional Fluid Tools
betterquesting.quest.dIUUo_wJTR6juTJGlEfuBQ.name=流体工具
betterquesting.quest.dIUUo_wJTR6juTJGlEfuBQ.desc=§6虹吸管§r是一种用于从机器中抽取流体的工具。潜行右键点击那些输入槽中有流体的机器，可以将流体倒入转移至你物品栏内相应的的通用流体罐、流体桶或移液管中（当然，前提是所抽取的流体量不足以填满这些容器）。%n%n而§6移液管§r则可用于精确地注入特定量的流体。通过右键点击或按住Shift键后右键点击，可以增加或减少注入流体的量。
